+## Submission Envelope
 
-## Open Design Choice: Concurrent Visit Edits
+A submission carries the following fields. The author is taken from authentication, never from the request body.
 
-OPEN: select the concurrency policy before completing this node's public contract.
+| Field | Required | Meaning |
+|---|---|---|
+| visit ID | Always | Client-generated visit UUID |
+| base revision ID | Except on a visit's first submission | The revision the worker last saw |
